# --- common symbols often present on Sharp PCs (verify positions) ------------
# Uncomment / adjust once confirmed from the E500 character ROM or manual.
# 5C U+00A5   # YEN SIGN (if this model uses 0x5C for yen)
# E0 U+03B1   # (verify) small alpha
# E1 U+00E4   # (verify)
# EB U+221A   # (verify) SQUARE ROOT
# EF U+03C0   # (verify) PI
# F1 U+00B0   # (verify) DEGREE SIGN
# FD U+00F7   # (verify) DIVISION SIGN
